### Регистрация
POST http://localhost:8081/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "client@example.com",
  "password": "P@ssw0rd123",
  "locale": "ru"
}

### Код смотри в логе auth-service (LoggingOtpSender), подставь ниже
POST http://localhost:8081/auth/otp/verify
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "target": "client@example.com",
  "purpose": "registration",
  "code": "000000"
}

### Профиль (подставь accessToken из ответа выше)
GET http://localhost:8081/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_ACCESS_TOKEN

### Логин по паролю
POST http://localhost:8081/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "login": "client@example.com",
  "password": "P@ssw0rd123"
}

### Ротация refresh
POST http://localhost:8081/auth/token/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "PASTE_REFRESH_TOKEN"
}

### Logout
POST http://localhost:8081/auth/logout
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "PASTE_REFRESH_TOKEN"
}

### JWKS
GET http://localhost:8081/oauth2/jwks

### 1. Получить SSO-токен от mock-mlm
GET http://localhost:9100/sso/issue-token?mlm_user_id=U1&upline_id=U0&access_status=access_paid

### 2. Обменять на наш JWT (подставь token из ответа выше)
POST http://localhost:8081/auth/sso/mlm
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "token": "PASTE_MLM_SSO_TOKEN"
}

### Служебное создание пользователя (для catalog/courier)
POST http://localhost:8081/internal/auth/users
Content-Type: application/json
X-Internal-Token: local-dev-internal-token-change-me

{
  "email": "shop-owner@example.com",
  "role": "CLIENT_EXTERNAL",
  "status": "active"
}
